# The embedding service on grace (README.md): the benchmark's GPU packages
# (../perf/grace-embedding/requirements-gpu.in, which says why each is pinned so) plus
# Starlette and uvicorn for the HTTP side. For grace only, not the stack's images.
# The lock file requirements-gpu.txt (with hashes, for aarch64) is made from this one:
#   uv pip compile --no-build --generate-hashes --python-platform aarch64-manylinux_2_34 \
#     --python-version 3.12 requirements-gpu.in -o requirements-gpu.txt
